sequenceDiagram
  participant C as S3 client
  participant G as radosgw
  participant I as index shard (.dir.<marker>.N)
  participant D as data pool
  C->>G: PUT /bucket/photos/a.jpg
  G->>G: hash(object name) → shard number
  G->>I: cls rgw.bucket_prepare_op (PENDING_MODIFY, tag)
  G->>D: write head (first 4MiB + xattr manifest, ACL, etag)
  G->>D: write tail stripes (<marker>__shadow_… every 4MiB)
  G->>I: cls rgw.bucket_complete_op (COMPLETE, size, etag, mtime)
  I-->>G: record in omap + bilog (for multisite)
  G-->>C: 200 OK + ETag
  Note over G,I: if RGW dies between prepare and complete, the pending entry is later cleaned by dir_suggest or bucket check
